  "details": "The upload has been interrupted for more than a week.\nThe gauge stops during the upload.If you continue with the upload, an Error dialog will appear, so I will cancel it.\nAfter that, when I started uploading again in LastBuild, I couldn't get the thumbnail of the world.You will receive an error as soon as you start the upload.This will not heal until Unity is restarted.\nWhen you restart Unity and start uploading in LastBuild again, the resume feature starts uploading halfway through the gauge.\nUploading a small 50M world will also cause this problem.\nSDK Version SDK3 2022.02.16.19.13",
